          "reason": "amend the approved Controller Gen1 plan to resolve the B2 contradiction for target repositories with zero non-terminal work items. The amendment should introduce the bounded `NoWorkItemYet` bootstrap path for the no-explicit-`--work-item` case, route that path to bare `/milestone-plan`, leave Workflow solely responsible for deriving and creating the new work-item ID from `docs/ACTIVE_MILESTONE.md`, identify the created work item by exact pre/post key-set difference, preserve refusal for an explicit nonexistent `--work-item`, preserve ambiguity for multiple candidates, and keep the existing 17-phase decision table unchanged for normal `WorkItemView` states.",
